## Proposed Changes

### Domain Models & Pipeline (`src/domain/ingestion/`)

#### [NEW] [DocumentTypes.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentTypes.ts)
- Define `DocumentType`: `'ANNUAL_REPORT' | 'FINANCIAL_STATEMENTS' | 'MDA' | 'CONCALL_TRANSCRIPT' | 'INVESTOR_PRESENTATION' | 'SHAREHOLDING_PATTERN' | 'SCREENER_SCREENSHOT' | 'TECHNICAL_CHART' | 'OTHER' | 'UNKNOWN'`
- Define `ProcessingStatus`: `'UPLOADED' | 'VALIDATING' | 'CLASSIFYING' | 'PAGE_EXTRACTING' | 'OCR_REQUIRED' | 'OCR_PROCESSING' | 'VERIFYING' | 'READY' | 'FAILED' | 'REQUIRES_REVIEW'`
- Define `ExtractionStatus`: `'PENDING' | 'PARTIAL' | 'COMPLETE' | 'FAILED'`
- Define `ProvenanceSourceType`: `'PRIMARY_SOURCE_DERIVED' | 'SCREENSHOT_DERIVED'`
- Define `ReportingPeriod`: `{ fiscalYear?: string; quarter?: string; periodType: 'ANNUAL' | 'QUARTERLY' | 'TRAILING_12M' | 'OTHER'; isIdentifiable: boolean; rawPeriodString?: string }`
- Define `DocumentPage`: `{ pageNumber: number; hasText: boolean; isScanned: boolean; textLength: number; textPreview: string; ocrApplied: boolean; ocrConfidence: number; ocrText?: string }`
- Define `IngestedDocument`: full provenance entity with `id`, `projectId`, `filename`, `fileHash`, `mimeType`, `sizeBytes`, `documentType`, `provenanceSourceType`, `reportingPeriod`, `processingStatus`, `ocrStatus`, `pages`, `dimensions`, `validationErrors`, `createdAt`.

#### [NEW] [DocumentClassifier.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentClassifier.ts)
- Deterministic heuristic keyword and metadata classifier.
- Classifies based on filename, mimeType, and content signatures.
- Reverts to `'UNKNOWN'` with `requiresReview: true` if confidence is below threshold.

#### [NEW] [PeriodDetector.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/PeriodDetector.ts)
- Deterministic reporting period and fiscal year extractor (e.g. FY24, FY2024, Q3FY24, 2023-2024).
- Checks consistency against company target symbol and name.

#### [NEW] [DocumentHasher.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentHasher.ts)
- Deterministic file hashing and duplicate detection across the research project document repository.

#### [NEW] [DocumentIngestionEngine.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentIngestionEngine.ts)
- Coordinates ingestion lifecycle:
  1. Validate file format, MIME type, and size (max 50MB).
  2. Compute hash and detect duplicate in project.
  3. Classify document type and detect period.
  4. Parse pages (distinguish machine-readable text vs scanned images).
  5. Apply OCR gating and confidence scoring (>90% High, 80-90% Medium, <80% Low).
  6. Return complete `IngestedDocument` entity.

#### [NEW] [TwoYearReportAudit.ts](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/TwoYearReportAudit.ts)
- Audits annual reports in the project for 2-year model readiness:
  - Detects if 2 distinct fiscal years exist (e.g. FY23 & FY24).
  - Flags duplicate year uploads (e.g. two FY24 reports).
  - Flags missing year or unidentifiable periods.
  - Flags company name inconsistencies.

